10 REM LOGIC GARDEN 117: TURNAROUND
20 PRINT CHR$(147) : REM CLEAR
30 POKE 53280, 0 : POKE 53281, 0 : REM BLACK

40 REM --- LOAD SPRITE DATA ---
50 REM BLOCK 200 (RIGHT), BLOCK 201 (LEFT)
60 REM (In a real scenario we would read data loops, assuming pre-load here)
70 REM *MOCK DATA LOAD*
80 POKE 2040, 201 : REM START FACING LEFT

100 REM --- SETUP ---
110 V = 53248
120 POKE V+21, 1 : REM ENABLE SPRITE 0
130 POKE V+39, 3 : REM CYAN
140 POKE V+23, 1 : POKE V+29, 1 : REM EXPAND
150 POKE V+1, 150 : REM Y

200 REM --- PHASE 1: WALK LEFT TO CENTER ---
210 FOR X = 345 TO 170 STEP -2
220   GOSUB 1000 : REM UPDATE SPRITE X
230   FOR W = 0 TO 5 : NEXT W : REM SPEED
240 NEXT X

300 REM --- PHASE 2: IDLE ---
310 FOR T = 0 TO 1000 : NEXT T : REM LONG PAUSE

400 REM --- PHASE 3: TURN ---
410 POKE 2040, 200 : REM SWAP POINTER TO RIGHT FACING
420 FOR T = 0 TO 500 : NEXT T : REM SHORT PAUSE BEFORE MOVING

500 REM --- PHASE 4: WALK RIGHT TO EXIT ---
510 FOR X = 170 TO 345 STEP 2
520   GOSUB 1000 : REM UPDATE SPRITE X
530   FOR W = 0 TO 5 : NEXT W
540 NEXT X

600 END

1000 REM --- SPRITE X LOGIC (MSB) ---
1010 IF X < 256 THEN POKE V, X : POKE V+16, 0 : RETURN
1020 IF X >= 256 THEN POKE V, X-256 : POKE V+16, 1 : RETURN
